    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.03",
    "summary": "Use it in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) as soon as a friendly **CHARACTER** unit is picked to fight, targeting that unit. Choose one **CHARACTER** model there; for the rest of the phase its melee weapons gain **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:core-rule/precision)**. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only [once in a phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
